      "DriverErasurePreflight": {
        "description": "Read-only actor-bound probe. manifestValid proves only exact shape and required UTC-day coverage, not membership or key-version/outbox completeness. COP attests the latter. A start request rechecks all gates and locks; this response never persists authorization.",
